   CIBSE TM59 Criterion A 00GROUNDFLOOR:LOUNGE,             !- Variable Name
   runperiod,                                            !- Reporting Frequency
   TM59_Living_Occ z00GROUNDFLOOR_LOUNGE TM59;!- schedule

Output:Variable,
